Step 1 – Count current protection vs full‐requirement for each field:
• Field_1 (req 2): 0 protecting, 0 flying → needs 2.
• Field_2 (req 6): 6 protecting (Drone_1, Drone_2, Drone_7, Drone_9, Drone_13, Drone_16), 0 flying → full.
